{
  "id": "mycookiecenter.app.sub",
  "name": "MyCookieCenter 签到与权益中心",
  "author": "@MyCookieCenter",
  "icon": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TomCatXue/MyCookieCenter/refs/heads/main/icons/icon.png",
  "repo": "https://github.com/TomCatXue/MyCookieCenter",
  "apps": [
    {
      "id": "weread_claim",
      "name": "微信读书",
      "keys": [
        "weread_auth_v2",
        "weread_flip_state_v1",
        "prefer_coin"
      ],
      "author": "@Codex",
      "icon": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TomCatXue/MyCookieCenter/refs/heads/main/icons/weread.png",
      "repo": "https://github.com/TomCatXue/MyCookieCenter",
      "script": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TomCatXue/MyCookieCenter/refs/heads/main/app/weread_claim/weread_claim.js",
      "settings": [
        {
          "id": "prefer_coin",
          "name": "奖励领取偏好",
          "val": "2",
          "type": "select",
          "items": [
            { "key": "1", "label": "优先体验卡" },
            { "key": "2", "label": "优先书币 (推荐)" }
          ],
          "desc": "设置阅读时长达标奖励偏好。设为优先书币时自动转换书币。"
        }
      ],
      "scripts": [
        {
          "name": "手动领阅读奖励",
          "script": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TomCatXue/MyCookieCenter/refs/heads/main/app/weread_claim/weread_claim.js"
        },
        {
          "name": "手动翻牌抽奖",
          "script": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TomCatXue/MyCookieCenter/refs/heads/main/app/weread_claim/weread_claim.js"
        }
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "name": "每日阅读奖励自动领取",
          "cron": "0 23 * * *",
          "script": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TomCatXue/MyCookieCenter/refs/heads/main/app/weread_claim/weread_claim.js"
        },
        {
          "name": "每周二自动翻牌抽奖",
          "cron": "0 20 * * 2",
          "script": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TomCatXue/MyCookieCenter/refs/heads/main/app/weread_claim/weread_claim.js"
        }
      ],
      "descs_html": [
        "<span><b>凭证捕获：</b>开启 CookieCenter 插件后，在微信读书 App 内阅读或刷新任一页面，即可自动捕获 vid、skey 与 refreshToken。</span>",
        "<span><b>阅读签到：</b>每日 23:00 自动检查阅读时长，达标后自动领取书币或体验卡。</span>",
        "<span><b>周二翻牌：</b>每周二晚 20:00 自动参与翻牌抽奖游戏。</span>"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "sx_ai_benefit",
      "name": "山西电信 · 体验AI领福利",
      "keys": [
        "sx_benefit_cookie",
        "sx_benefit_url",
        "sx_benefit_utm_scha",
        "sx_benefit_ua",
        "sx_monitor_current_code",
        "sx_monitor_notified_month",
        "sx_capture_notified_code",
        "sx_prefer_benefit"
      ],
      "author": "@Codex",
      "icon": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TomCatXue/MyCookieCenter/refs/heads/main/icons/189.png",
      "repo": "https://github.com/TomCatXue/MyCookieCenter",
      "script": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TomCatXue/MyCookieCenter/refs/heads/main/plugins/sx_ai_benefit/sx_ai_benefit.js",
      "settings": [
        {
          "id": "sx_prefer_benefit",
          "name": "月度权益目标选择",
          "val": "tc_member",
          "type": "select",
          "items": [
            { "key": "tc_member", "label": "腾讯视频 VIP 会员 31 天 (限量1000份·需短信)" },
            { "key": "tc_flow", "label": "3GB 国内流量包 (当月有效·免验证码秒到)" },
            { "key": "tc_tele", "label": "1~20 元随机话费满减券 (需翼支付实名)" }
          ],
          "desc": "每人每月限领一项。推荐视频会员，亦可选择免验证的 3GB 流量。"
        },
        {
          "id": "sx_benefit_cookie",
          "name": "当前会话 Cookie",
          "val": "",
          "type": "text",
          "desc": "进入活动页面后自动抓取，亦支持在此手动配置与更新。"
        },
        {
          "id": "sx_benefit_url",
          "name": "活动完整 URL",
          "val": "",
          "type": "text",
          "desc": "包含 ticket 与活动批次标识的完整活动地址。"
        }
      ],
      "scripts": [
        {
          "name": "执行探针探测 / 状态自检",
          "script": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TomCatXue/MyCookieCenter/refs/heads/main/plugins/sx_ai_benefit/sx_ai_benefit.js"
        }
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "name": "每月1-8号放水监控与探针",
          "cron": "*/20 8-19 1-8 * *",
          "script": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TomCatXue/MyCookieCenter/refs/heads/main/plugins/sx_ai_benefit/sx_ai_benefit.js"
        }
      ],
      "descs_html": [
        "<span><b>凭据捕获：</b>开启 CookieCenter 插件后，在电信 APP 首页 AI 搜索“领福利”进入活动，自动记录凭证（新批次单次提示）。</span>",
        "<span><b>智能监控：</b>每月 1~8 号自动低频随机监控服务端放水状态，绝不报任何证书错误。</span>",
        "<span><b>单次提醒：</b>一旦检测到新批次放水立即发送直达通知，点击直通电信 APP 极速抢兑；当月完成即深度休眠。</span>"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "bestpay_coin",
      "name": "翼支付 · 权益币与绿色能量",
      "keys": [
        "bestpay_auto_star",
        "bestpay_auto_sign",
        "bestpay_auto_box"
      ],
      "author": "@Codex",
      "icon": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TomCatXue/MyCookieCenter/refs/heads/main/icons/bestpay_coin.png",
      "repo": "https://github.com/TomCatXue/MyCookieCenter",
      "script": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TomCatXue/MyCookieCenter/refs/heads/main/plugins/bestpay_coin/bestpay_coin.js",
      "settings": [
        {
          "id": "bestpay_auto_star",
          "name": "自动一键全收权益币/能量球",
          "val": true,
          "type": "boolean",
          "desc": "进入赚钱专区页面时，自动调用 starReceive 接口收光所有漂浮币。"
        },
        {
          "id": "bestpay_auto_sign",
          "name": "自动每日签到打卡",
          "val": true,
          "type": "boolean",
          "desc": "进入页面时自动完成每日签到发奖。"
        },
        {
          "id": "bestpay_auto_box",
          "name": "自动开启每日福利宝箱",
          "val": true,
          "type": "boolean",
          "desc": "进入页面时自动开启每日定时宝箱。"
        }
      ],
      "scripts": [
        {
          "name": "一键收币与签到自检",
          "script": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TomCatXue/MyCookieCenter/refs/heads/main/plugins/bestpay_coin/bestpay_coin.js"
        }
      ],
      "descs_html": [
        "<span><b>免抓包注入：</b>由 CookieCenter 插件拦截 H5 页面并注入轻量执行引擎。</span>",
        "<span><b>秒级搞定：</b>打开翼支付 App “赚钱专区”或“绿色能量”页面瞬间，全自动一键收光所有权益币、自动签到、自动开宝箱。</span>",
        "<span><b>官方通道：</b>通过 App 内置已鉴权的官方 JSBridge 调度，零风控、零证书报错。</span>"
      ]
